WEBVTT

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.320
This is the safety,

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:09.610
and this is...

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:11.440
Actually, forget the gun.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.280
I've got Void Maker.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.160
There shouldn't be any 
problems if you're with him.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:19.700
Boy,

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:23.120
you've heard the details of the 
operation from Izzy, right?

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.580
Show me what you're capable of.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.590
I'll take part in your operation.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.090
Izzy's done a lot for me, after all.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:32.840
But what about Touko?

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:35.720
I'll guarantee her safety.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.180
Don't worry.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.720
We'll do what we can about the 
tattoo on her forehead, too.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:44.440
We just might reap good results 
from this operation.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:47.520
If it's like the ruins in America,

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.900
it's possible we could 
obtain even more tattoos.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:54.070
I-I'm sorry for insisting on coming along.

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:55.780
Thanks for having me.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.780
We'll introduce the principal 
players while we have the time.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:02.120
This muscleman is the

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:05.160
commander for this operation, 
Brigadier General Sanders.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.630
Call him "Colonel." That's his preference.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:11.800
Man, this is some fucking storm. 
Seriously fucking.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:14.170
This Asian boy is Second Lieutenant Wang.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.510
Hey, little lady, when all this is over,

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.510
why don't we go out for some tea?

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:20.350
Hey!

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:23.850
And this weirdo playing the 
underdog is Captain Johnson.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.060
That's a rude thing to say to 
a superior officer, you know.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.980
And I'm Lisa! We've met, remember?

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:32.150
H-Hi...

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:36.320
And this big guy is Major Leonardo Burns.

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:39.280
He looks a little scary, 
but he's basically a nice guy.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.290
N-Nice to meet you.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.660
And that's all of the original Sealed.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.540
We'll also have about twenty

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:51.630
Sealed copies taking part in the operation.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:55.470
In other words, we're putting all of

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:58.630
the tattoo forces stationed 
in Japan on this operation.

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:00.850
Listen up, all of you!

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:03.060
Anyone who bares their fangs at our country

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.520
must have their skulls 
crushed by fire and iron!

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:09.150
That's how we do things!

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:43.490
Storm

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.130
BB,

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.850
the American tattoo force is on the move.

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:09.220
<i>It seems they're going to ambush the ruins 
where the princess and her cronies are.</i>

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.220
What?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:14.350
Wiseman, let me out of here.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.520
You want to save Izzy, eh?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.570
But you can't.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:24.780
The princess has Brahman's 
strongest Sealed by her side.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.990
It may be a trap, as well.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:30.620
Damn it...

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.040
If you fight before the code 
modification is complete,

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.540
you'll only die in vain.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.090
Do you want your plan to come to nothing?

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.380
<i>It's almost done. Be patient.</i>

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:43.880
All right!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:48.010
Ram a big, fat sausage up their asses!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.050
Hey, come on! Make them stop!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:24.470
Boy,

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.550
I think you've got the wrong idea here.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.100
This is war.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.140
Weren't you prepared for that 
when you came with us?

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.980
We'll give back what they've done to us!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:35.350
Right!

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.850
Okay, that's enough of that.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:42.320
Ram a hot dog on French bread up their asses!

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.690
Bombard!

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:54.120
Seigi, don't do anything reckless.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:55.370
I'm not joking around!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.710
I'm going to finish this!

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.630
S-Seigi, I...

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:02.590
I'll be back!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.630
S-See you soon...

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.880
Hey, wait!

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:11.010
Jeez... And I thought he'd grown up a bit!

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.860
<i>Back me up, men.</i>

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:30.570
Captain Johnson...

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.120
Hey there, black-haired beauty!

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.790
Do you like hardcore play?

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:42.170
I understand. You're shy.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:46.010
Come here and I'll make you 
numb with my burning heat!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.640
Huh? That's odd...

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.490
No wonder...

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:14.370
Pleasure to meet you.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:18.370
I am Cal Shekhar, vice-captain of Brahman.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:21.790
Though it may be forward of me, 
I shall be your opponent.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.880
Bring it on, savages!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.180
Reporting.

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:40.730
The enemy numbers about thirty,

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.850
flying in several Black Hawks.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.940
Their physical ability leads us to infer

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.110
that the majority are Sealed.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:52.150
That may be tiring for Cal and 
her maids, numbering seven.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.200
Il, touch this.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:57.330
I will lend you some strength.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.370
Go and assist Cal.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.120
Yes, ma'am.

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:07.460
Your tattoo will be temporarily 
under my control.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.880
I'll stop any power from flowing 
into that little girl, too.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.090
Even if only for a short time,

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.760
it should be possible to assume authority 
and control over the source.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:22.480
Go, lonely Beast King.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.820
<i>She pierced the air barrier!</i>

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:34.860
<i>The noise canceler!</i>

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:42.960
Tom!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.170
<i>She's just a copy Sealed.</i>

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.960
<i>How can she keep up with me?</i>

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.510
I'll plug you full of holes!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.060
How about this, then?!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.460
There is only one fear of death:

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.340
the fear that tomorrow will never come.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:37.720
I see...

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.430
So that's the one with Aegis Armadillo.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.470
<i>Found her!</i>

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.230
<i>No.</i>

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.730
<i>What did I learn from BB?</i>

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.610
<i>She's not the one I should be after.</i>

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.070
<i>It's their boss, the princess!</i>

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.370
Akatsuka Seigi.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.500
Be quiet and still for just a bit.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.710
There's no need for you to fight.

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.880
<i>She's on a totally different level!</i>

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:18.220
Damn...

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:22.350
Your simply being here right 
now is all that matters.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.520
Damn it!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.140
Seigi!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.190
It's all right.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:31.650
That's not enough to kill the boy 
with the triggerless tattoo.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.070
B-But...

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.650
<i>He won't die, but...</i>

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.050
The noise canceler?!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.270
Th-That girl...

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.040
Tom, are you okay?

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.380
Thanks to you, Lieutenant.

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:48.640
<i>I had it all wrong.</i>

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.480
<i>No matter how strong Brahman is,</i>

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.520
<i>I thought we couldn't lose 
with this many troops.</i>

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.780
<i>Blood was right.</i>

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.030
<i>As far as the Kingdom is concerned,</i>

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.620
<i>America doesn't even count as a 
rival in the race for the tattoos.</i>

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:17.590
CAT! CAT!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.800
Black Hawk down! Black Hawk down!

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.260
I'm losing control! We're crashing!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.020
Don't bite your tongue, little girl.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.570
Take care of her.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:52.200
For his huge size, he's...

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:57.710
This is...

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.420
That power...

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:05.050
Was that Emphasis Shift?

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:08.970
This baby has no trouble 
busting through your wall.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.010
Colonel!

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:14.060
Two against one, is it? Fine.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.350
Bring it on!

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.360
Sorry, but this isn't some street fight!

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.220
Welcome back, Princess.

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:51.890
Yeah.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:55.180
It seems the leader of the enemy 
force is Colonel Sanders.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:58.850
Indeed. He never learns.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:04.110
If Sanders and BB were a couple, 
who do you think would be the uke?

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.950
W-Well...

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.120
I think I would go with BB-san...

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.330
You're so precious.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.580
You mustn't, Princess...

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.880
Go and collect the scattered 
tattoos for me.

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.040
Yes... Certainly...

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:36.310
<i>Not a single shot reached her!</i>

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:37.680
<i>In that case...</i>

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:42.110
<i>Ouch...</i>

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.360
<i>Is this...</i>

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:53.990
Decompression, eh?

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.750
Yes, I drastically reduced the air density.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.210
<i>She's collecting air inside her wall?</i>

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.850
Izzy!

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.520
<i>Her sword won't reach me 
in this space of time!</i>

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:33.240
The absolute boundary line 
that divides all things...

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.950
Your special weapon is your power itself!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.880
America will not lose to the Kingdom...

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.710
Not to you!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:48.050
Excessive ambition is the

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:50.670
proof of foolishness that will 
bring your own destruction.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.840
There is darkness in your nation's future.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.890
<i>I can't use my left arm anymore.</i>

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:04.060
<i>I was finished the moment my 
body was caught in that.</i>

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.360
You are Lieutenant Fruesy?

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:08.820
What?

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:11.360
You know me?

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:15.120
What an honor, vice-captain of Brahman.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.870
I suppose you don't know me.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.500
<i>There's no Sealed in America that can</i>

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:22.660
<i>take on this monster...</i>

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:24.790
Die.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:28.130
<i>Up against the wall, eh?</i>

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.680
So you followed the bait

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:43.310
and showed yourself so easily before me.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.730
All for one girl...

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.360
What a foolish man.

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.690
BB!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.570
Blood... Why?

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.120
Did you say Blood?

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:00.240
Johnson, Wang, and Sanders...

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:04.410
I may have left the US Army, 
but we're still war buddies.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.330
I will avenge them.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.500
Don't count me as dead!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:12.630
You must realize that you cannot defeat me.

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:15.800
You are only dancing in the

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.510
palm of the princess's hand.

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:21.810
Maybe, but Arya isn't the Buddha.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.640
I will win in the end.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:24.940
<i>Wait...</i>

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:28.480
<i>Was this all just a trap 
to lure Blood here?</i>

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:33.440
His tattoo is active, 
so his vision is sharp.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:33.440
His vision is sharp.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.440
<i>BB... Soon I'll be...</i>

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.490
Crawling on the ground?

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:41.030
Do you want to see my panties that badly?

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.620
And BB is as foolish as they come.

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:49.330
That no-kill policy is nothing 
but a hindrance to the goal.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:53.300
If he'd toss it by the wayside, 
he'd have a chance at winning.

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:56.220
What do you know about BB?!

00:17:58.590 --> 00:17:59.930
<i>What is this wall?</i>

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:06.940
<i>Just how many abilities can this chick use?</i>

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:07.890
It won't pull free.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.730
It's already become a 
part of my earth wall.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:16.360
We're gonna stop your schemes.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:18.950
You think we'll let you rewrite the world?

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.410
Why not?

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:21.120
Huh?

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:24.870
What I wish to do is build a better world.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.620
What could be bad about that?

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:29.460
What about the people who get overwritten?!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:32.090
You can't call it "justice" 
if you make a better world

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:33.630
by trampling on the will of the people!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:34.500
I won't accept it!

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.420
The truth is, you're just saying 
things that sound good

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:40.840
when all you want is a world that 
suits your purposes, right?!

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:43.680
And if so, what will you do?

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:46.060
Do you think you can take away all discord

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:49.480
in the world with your idea of "justice"?

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:50.690
That's...

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:51.940
Nonsense.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:54.820
You're no more than a middle 
school boy who dreams too much.

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:59.740
You speak grandly of justice with 
a childish, vague sense of ethics.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:02.740
Yet there isn't even a clear vision within it.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:06.910
Now, what I want is your key,

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.870
not you yourself, you imbecile.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:11.580
<i>My... key?</i>

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:16.050
I was the one who leaked the information 
on this place to the US Army.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.300
What?!

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:20.840
I knew they would bring 
an army of Sealed here,

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:23.640
and one of them would be your guardian...

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.260
Izzy, was it?

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:28.390
It was a plan I concocted knowing 
she'd involve herself.

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:34.480
Did you know that when she and BB 
lived in America, they were lovers?

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:36.360
<i>BB and Izzy?</i>

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:41.030
So he fell for the bait easily and came here.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.530
This is how it will end:

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:45.740
BB will exhaust his energy and

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:48.040
be devoured by the collective source.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:52.120
I will then take that into myself 
and obtain my second key.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.880
<i>Devour? Take in?</i>

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.670
And as for you...

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:58.340
S-Stop! Don't!

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:04.090
I will give you despair and hatred.

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:06.010
Watch from here

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:08.680
as you curse your own powerlessness.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.940
Happy endings bore me.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.820
Power may be tantamount to justice,

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.780
but the reverse is by no means true!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.370
Cal.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.080
It's no use pleading for your life now.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:37.040
I need you to fulfill 
your destiny as a key.

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.630
You're in love with me, aren't you?

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:46.340
Wha— What nonsense is 
this, all of a sudden?!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:50.100
So I was right. Your face is red.

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:58.730
Love

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:54.100
M-My temperature is just high 
because I've been fighting!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.520
As if I would ever be drawn to a man

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:58.730
who can't even beat a woman!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.480
That habit of yours.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:03.950
Whenever you lie, 
you fiddle with your hair.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:06.160
I-I'm not lying!

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:08.240
Cal, just be honest.

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:12.450
Spouting excuses makes you 
look pathetic, as a warrior.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:16.040
Th-Th-Th-That's right!

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:18.670
I am in love with you,

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:20.840
and do you have a problem with that?!

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:23.630
I-I-I-It has nothing to do 
with what's happening now!

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.010
Sorry, though.

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:31.970
H-Hey...

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:34.680
My heart belongs to her.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:38.190
I'm not gonna let you, Arya,

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:40.690
or any tattoo have even a shred of it.

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:48.780
I can't say I disliked that 
honest-to-a-fault side of you.

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:01.880
Did you think I just walked into

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:04.760
your trap completely unprepared?

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:07.050
This will end it.

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:09.010
Come as if you mean to kill me.

00:23:41.350 --> 00:23:43.100
I hate tattoos.

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:45.480
I could never like something

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:47.480
that took everything from me.

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:49.150
But I...

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:52.780
No! Wait! Wait, Blood!

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:54.950
Creator

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:54.570
Blood!
